    {
      "tag": "v0.1.2",
      "name": "v0.1.2 for MC BDS 26.0",
      "publishedAt": "2026-02-16T12:04:40Z",
      "prerelease": false,
      "draft": false,
      "notes": "### __What's New__\r\n- __**Minecraft 26.0 Support**__\r\n- `/loadnearbychunks <shouldLoad: Boolean>`: Enables/disables player chunk loading.\r\n- `/pistonpushlimit [n: int]`: Sets the piston push limit.\r\n### __Improvements__\r\n- `/tick rate <n: int>`: Now allows rates of up to 100k.\r\n### __Fixes__\r\n- `/flyspeed`: Improved argument edge case handling, including preventing a crash.\r\nWelcome to our new contributor, @Nipitare!",
